   "stem_html": "The following <i>volume.py</i> module causes a side effect.\n<pre class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">import math\n\ndef sphere(radius):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\"\"\"Gets the volume of a sphere.\"\"\"\n&nbsp;&nbsp;return 4/3 * math.pi * radius**3\n\nfor r in range(10000000):\n&nbsp;&nbsp;volume = sphere(r)\n</pre>",
